// 示例：把首选模型排到最前（复制为 prefer-model.mjs 即生效；或放 ~/.config/mslxdff/plugins/ 永久生效）
const PREFER = "big-pickle";

export default {
  name: "prefer-model",
  version: "1.0.0",
  description: `auto 时优先使用 ${PREFER}`,
  hooks: {
    "model:select": (ctx) => {
      if (!ctx.order.includes(PREFER)) return;
      return [PREFER, ...ctx.order.filter((m) => m !== PREFER)];
    },
  },
};
